---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
<Fragment slot="head">
<meta name="description" content="A free one page website template for product brands and online sellers. Setup guide, AI prompts, and field checklist included. Download it and own it.">
<title>Free Product Brand Website Template (Single HTML File) | BlueYucca</title>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://blueyucca.com/templates/product-brand">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="BlueYucca">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Free Product Brand Website Template (Single HTML File) | BlueYucca">
<meta property="og:description" content="A free one page website template for product brands and online sellers. Setup guide, AI prompts, and field checklist included. Download it and own it.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://blueyucca.com/templates/product-brand">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<style is:inline>
  :root {
    --cream: #FAF6ED; --cream-deep: #F3ECDC; --card: #FFFDF8;
    --sand: #E5DAC3; --sand-dark: #D5C6A5;
    --ink: #1E2A45; --ink-soft: #52607E;
    --blue: #2455C4; --blue-deep: #17357F; --blue-dark: #1B3A8C;
    --blue-soft: #4B79DC; --blue-wash: #E9EFFB; --blue-line: #C9D8F5;
    --haz: #F2C94C;
    --mono: "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  ::selection { background: var(--blue); color: var(--cream); }
  a { color: var(--blue); }
  .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
  .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  }
  header.site {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(250,246,237,0.88);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 13px 24px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .brand {
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.45rem; color: var(--blue-deep);
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    transform: rotate(-2deg); display: inline-block;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--sand); transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .brand:hover { transform: rotate(1deg) scale(1.04); }
  .brand .b1 { color: var(--blue); } .brand .b2 { color: var(--ink); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; transition: color 0.15s ease; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--blue); }
  .nav-links .nav-cta {
    background: var(--blue); color: #fff; padding: 8px 18px;
    border: 2px solid var(--blue-deep); border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--blue-deep); transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease;
  }
  .nav-links .nav-cta:hover { color: #fff; transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--blue-deep); }
  .hero { padding: 64px 0 40px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.1rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 850; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2vw, 1.15rem); color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 40em; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  section { padding: 8px 0 56px; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blue);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--blue-line); background: var(--blue-wash);
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 10px; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); margin: 42px 0 12px; }
  h3 { color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--blue-deep); margin: 4px 8px 4px 0;
    transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--blue-deep); }
  .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--blue-deep); }
  .btn-ghost { color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--card); box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--sand-dark); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--sand-dark); }
  .note {
    background: var(--blue-wash); border: 2px solid var(--blue-line); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 22px; font-size: 0.98rem; margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .pricetag {
    display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--haz);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 10px;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--sand-dark); transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }
  ul.check { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 16px 0; }
  ul.check li { padding: 7px 0 7px 32px; position: relative; color: var(--ink); }
  ul.check li::before {
    content: "\2713"; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 7px;
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 900; font-family: var(--mono);
  }
  .promptbox {
    background: #141821; color: #C7E3D4; border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 22px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6;
    white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 16px 0; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--sand-dark);
  }
  .retro-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--blue-deep); background: var(--card);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 5px 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--sand-dark);
  }
  footer.site-footer { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); margin-top: 48px; padding: 40px 0 48px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.93rem; }
  footer.site-footer nav { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  footer.site-footer nav a { color: var(--blue-deep); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; font-weight: 600; }
  footer.site-footer nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; } .hero { padding: 44px 0 28px; } }
</style>
</Fragment>
<header class="site">
  <div class="nav">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="b1">Blue</span><span class="b2">Yucca</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="/business-in-a-box">Business in a Box</a>
      <a href="/examples">Examples</a>
      <a href="/prompt-builder">Prompt Builder</a>
      <a href="/hosting">Hosting Guide</a>
      <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
      <a href="/#about">About</a>
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="/business-in-a-box">Open the box</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Product brand or online seller</span>
    <h1>Product Brand Template.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A one page site for anyone who sells things: your story up top, your best products in the middle, and links to wherever people can buy. Modeled on a real, live product brand site. See it in the wild: <a href="https://bohst.co">bohst.co</a></p>
    <div style="margin-bottom:14px"><span class="pricetag">$0.00 &middot; MARKED DOWN FROM $0.00</span></div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/downloads/product-brand-template.html" download>Download the template</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/downloads/product-brand-template.html">View demo</a>
  </section>

  <h2 class="reveal">Gather these before you start</h2>\n  <p>Ten minutes with this checklist saves an hour of back and forth later.</p>
  <ul class="check">
    <li>Your brand name and a one line tagline</li>\n    <li>Your story in two or three short paragraphs (when you started, what you believe)</li>\n    <li>Three or four products with a name, one sentence each, and a photo if you have one</li>\n    <li>Links to where people can buy (your store, a marketplace, retail partners)</li>\n    <li>Your city and state for the footer</li>\n    <li>Two colors you like, or the colors from your logo</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="reveal">Recommended prompt</h2>
  <p>Download the template, then paste this into Claude, ChatGPT, or Gemini along with the template file (or its code). Fill in your own details where the brackets are.</p>
  <div class="promptbox">I am a small business owner, not a developer. Attached is a simple HTML template
for a product brand website. Please fill it in with my real information and keep
the code simple and in one file.

My brand: [your brand name]
Tagline: [one short line]
Our story: [two or three sentences in your own words]
Products: [name and one sentence for each, three or four total]
Where to buy: [links]
City and state: [yours]
Colors: [two colors you like]

Please keep all the text plain and honest, no marketing hype. When you are done,
give me the complete HTML file and tell me in simple steps how to save it.</div>

  <h2 class="reveal">After the first draft</h2>
  <p>Ask for changes the same way you would ask a person. For example: "Make the story section shorter," or "Swap the blue for forest green," or "Add a fourth product." Small, plain requests work best.</p>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>A quick coaching note:</strong> results vary between Claude, ChatGPT, and Gemini, and even the same tool can give different answers on different days. That is normal, not a sign you did something wrong. Keep the conversation going until it looks right, and save a copy of any version you like.
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="retro-badge">YOU OWN THIS FILE. AND THAT ONE. ALL OF THEM.</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a> &middot;
      <a href="/business-in-a-box">Business in a Box</a> &middot;
      <a href="/examples">Examples</a> &middot;
      <a href="/prompt-builder">Prompt Builder</a> &middot;
      <a href="/hosting">Hosting Guide</a> &middot;
      <a href="/blog/">Blog</a> &middot;
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a> &middot;
      <a href="/frontpage/">The FrontPage Experiment</a> &middot;
      <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@blueyucca">TikTok</a>
    </nav>
    <div>BlueYucca is a <a href="https://cultivatum.com">Cultivatum LLC</a> project, part of the <a href="https://kakt.ai">kakt.ai</a> family. Arizona, est. 2003.</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>
(function () {
  var els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) { els.forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('in'); }); return; }
  var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
    entries.forEach(function (e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
  }, { threshold: 0.12 });
  els.forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
})();
</script>
</Layout>
